      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-07-26_WidnesExaminer_art0110" n="art0110">
        <head>" AKOU=SOUND "</head>
        <p>" AKOU=SOUND "</p>
        <p>APPlinlirrUS.</p>
        <p>Actually IMPROVES AND CURES (certain forms) of deafness and head noises. Various Institutions for the Deaf have used this apparatus with remarkable results. The Medical Profession send patients to undergo this treatment.</p>
