      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-07-26_WidnesExaminer_art0111" n="art0111">
        <head>14 DAYS' TRIAL and HIRE ARRANGED.</head>
        <p>14 DAYS' TRIAL and HIRE ARRANGED.</p>
