        <p>9.30 to 12.30— Saturday to 4.30.</p>
        <p>Demonstrations of these two inventions are now being given daily at Warrington for a short time, and everyone suffering from deafness or head noises is invited to call for a FREE TEST.</p>
        <p>Over 500 letters have been received from deaf people testifying to the marvellous improvement made thy the Akou-Sound cure, including many from the Medical Profession.</p>
